---
---
<div class="phone" aria-hidden="true">

  <!-- Contact header -->
  <div class="phone-header">
    <div class="phone-avatar">MD</div>
    <div>
      <div class="phone-name">Mike Delgado</div>
      <div class="phone-sub">(720) 555-0247 · 4th season</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- AI context summary -->
  <div class="ai-summary">
    <div class="ai-sum-head">
      <span class="ai-dot"></span>
      <span class="ai-label">Foremann knows this client</span>
    </div>
    <div class="ai-sum-body">Spring cleanup quote ($340) sent 4 days ago. Mike said he'd check with his wife — hasn't replied since. Good time to follow up.</div>
  </div>

  <!-- Mid-conversation thread -->
  <div class="bubbles">
    <div class="bubble bubble-in">Can you also do the back hedges while you're at it?</div>
    <div class="bubble bubble-out">Yeah, hedge trim included. New total is $340. Sending the quote now.</div>
    <div class="bubble bubble-in">Perfect. Let me check with my wife and I'll get back to you.</div>
    <div class="thread-gap">4 days · no reply</div>
  </div>

  <!-- AI proactive follow-up -->
  <div class="ai-card">
    <div class="ai-head">
      <span class="ai-dot"></span>
      <span class="ai-label">Suggested Follow-up</span>
    </div>
    <div class="ai-body">Hey Mike — just checking in on that spring cleanup quote. Happy to lock in a date whenever you're ready.</div>
    <div class="ai-actions">
      <button type="button" class="ai-btn ai-btn-edit">Edit</button>
      <button type="button" class="ai-btn ai-btn-send">Send</button>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>
